@startuml
title View Vocabulary Details Sequence (/vocabulary/{id} and /api/words/{id})

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary Details UI" as VocabularyDetailsUi
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as FeController
control "WordsController\n(BE API)" as BeController
entity "WordDetail\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordDetailDto
entity "WordDetailResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeWordDetailDto
control "WordReadService" as WordService
control "IWordReadService" as IWordReadService
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordSense" as WordSenseEntity
entity "WordExample" as WordExampleEntity
entity "WordRelation" as WordRelationEntity
entity "WordAudioAsset" as WordAudioAssetEntity
entity "WordDerivedForm" as WordDerivedFormEntity
entity "WordIdiom" as WordIdiomEntity
entity "WordTopic" as WordTopicEntity
entity "Topic" as TopicEntity
control "WordReadRepository" as WordRepository
control "IWordReadRepository" as IWordReadRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over VocabularyDetailsUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard UI file exists: Views/Vocabulary/Detail.cshtml.
FE controller exists: VocabularyController.
BE controller exists: WordsController.
FE response DTO exists: WordDetail.
BE response DTO exists: WordDetailResponse.
VocabularyController.Detail calls VocaNovaApiClient.GetWordDetailAsync.
API endpoint is GET /api/words/{id}; no request DTO body is used.
Entities exist: Word, WordSense, WordExample, WordRelation,
WordAudioAsset, WordDerivedForm, WordIdiom, WordTopic and Topic.
Interfaces used in code: IWordReadService, IWordReadRepository.
end note

Admin -> VocabularyDetailsUi: Open vocabulary details
VocabularyDetailsUi -> FeController: GET /vocabulary/{id}
FeController -> BeController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetWordDetailAsync\nGET /api/words/{id}
BeController -> IWordReadService: GetByIdAsync(id)
IWordReadService -> WordService: GetByIdAsync(id)

alt Word id invalid
    WordService --> BeController: NotFound result
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 404 error
    FeController --> VocabularyDetailsUi: Show not found
else Word id valid
    WordService -> IWordReadRepository: FindDetailAsync(id)
    IWordReadRepository -> WordRepository: FindDetailAsync(id)
    WordRepository -> DbContext: Query word detail
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words with includes
    MySQL --> DbContext: Word detail rows or null

    alt Word not found
        DbContext --> WordRepository: null
        WordRepository --> WordService: null
        WordService --> BeController: NotFound result
        BeController --> FeController: HTTP 404 error
        FeController --> VocabularyDetailsUi: Show not found
    else Word found
        DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word
        DbContext -> WordSenseEntity: Read WordSenses
        DbContext -> WordExampleEntity: Read WordExamples
        DbContext -> WordRelationEntity: Read WordRelations
        DbContext -> WordAudioAssetEntity: Read playable WordAudioAssets
        DbContext -> WordDerivedFormEntity: Read WordDerivedForms
        DbContext -> WordIdiomEntity: Read WordIdioms
        DbContext -> WordTopicEntity: Read WordTopics
        DbContext -> TopicEntity: Read linked Topics
        WordEntity --> DbContext: Word
        WordSenseEntity --> DbContext: WordSense rows
        WordExampleEntity --> DbContext: WordExample rows
        WordRelationEntity --> DbContext: WordRelation rows
        WordAudioAssetEntity --> DbContext: WordAudioAsset rows
        WordDerivedFormEntity --> DbContext: WordDerivedForm rows
        WordIdiomEntity --> DbContext: WordIdiom rows
        WordTopicEntity --> DbContext: WordTopic rows
        TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic rows

        DbContext --> WordRepository: Word detail graph
        WordRepository --> WordService: Word detail
        WordService --> BeController: Word detail result
        BeController -> BeWordDetailDto: Create WordDetailResponse
        BeWordDetailDto --> BeController: WordDetailResponse
        BeController -> FeWordDetailDto: HTTP 200 OK\nWordDetailResponse JSON
        FeWordDetailDto --> FeController: WordDetail
        FeController --> VocabularyDetailsUi: Render vocabulary details
    end
end

@enduml
